    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Clase bcn is a long-established Barcelona branding and design studio (founded 1978 by Claret Serrahima; since 2001 led by Daniel Ayuso, creative director, and Sandra Parcet, executive director). Team of ~10 multidisciplinary designers doing branding, visual identity systems, art direction and campaigns from strategy through execution; clients include Palau de la Musica, Fundacio Miro, Oysho, Vibia, Kave Home. A mature, senior studio (40+ yrs heritage, ~25 yrs under current leadership). Studio (specialist hands-on design team) not Agency. Size 2-10 (team of ten, per their own studio page) confirmed. Work is full brand programmes (Identity systems) beyond the Jonathan-set Graphic design tag.",
